# ── SphinxGate — Git line-ending policy ─────────────────────────────────────
# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo (Unix-style).
# Git will convert to CRLF on checkout on Windows if core.autocrlf=true,
# but the repo itself always stores LF — no mixed line endings.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark binary files so Git never messes with them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
